<tr><td></td><td colspan="8" style="vertical-align:middle">    Do nhu c\u1EA7u c\xE1 nh\xE2n, t\xF4i xin r\xFAt ti\u1EC1n vay m\u1ED9t ph\u1EA7n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc h\u1EA1n c\u1EE5 th\u1EC3 nh\u01B0 sau:</td></tr>
